{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e00c6a82-5a5e-8d59-8e0a-f99f7ecdecba",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T12:07:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, yeah, hi. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, so I figured I'd try the storm line. Can you hear me okay? I'm [line breaks up] standing outside and the reception is terrible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:02:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're cutting in and out a little. Try again, I caught 'City Hall's closed.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, sorry. I said I'm calling the storm line because it's the weekend. My name's Yusuf Abdi, I'm a landlord, and I own a building at 468 Ayrault Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 468 Ayrault. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, after the coastal storm yesterday, the Friday-Saturday one, the grate at the curb in front of my place has sunk. Like it dropped down below the pavement, so it's basically a little bowl. And the water goes everywhere but down it. It runs across the sidewalk and pools up by my front steps. I'm out here in my boots, a genius in a puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so the grate itself has settled lower than the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, exactly. And honestly this keeps happening. Every time it rains hard, same thing. I've [inaudible] looked at it before and nobody's ever done anything about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me. Did you say you've reported it before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it's been like this for a while and it never gets fixed. I'm not saying it's you personally, Denise. I'm just saying the grate and I are both tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Is the water getting into the building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not inside, no, not yet. But the real issue is my neighbor next door. She's older, and she can't get out when it's like this. The water sits right where she has to step to get to the walkway. She's been stuck in the house since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that matters. Is she okay otherwise? Does she need anything from emergency services?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, she's fine. She's got groceries. She just can't safely get down the steps with all that water. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:04:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that there's a neighbor who has trouble getting out. Let me get some details so I can put this in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sorry, I'm going to walk to where I get a bar or two. Hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:05:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, better. Can you hear me now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better. So the grate is right at the curb in front of 468, and it's sunk below the road surface. Is it cracked or just dropped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just dropped, I think. It looks whole, but the pavement around it has caved in a bit. Like a dip, maybe a foot or two around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. A depression around the grate. Let me read it back: sunken catch basin grate, curb in front of 468 Ayrault, water pooling onto the sidewalk and steps, elderly neighbor affected."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. So, will you guys open a work order for that? And can you tell me for what date? Like, when somebody comes out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open a work order right now. As for the date, the crews are going to be busy with storm calls this week, so I'd say it'll be somewhere in the next few days to a week for someone to look at it. I can't promise a particular day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:06:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days to a week. Okay. I mean, it's been like this since forever, so a week's practically a sprint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:06:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, I hear you. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled? What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189. And that's Yusuf?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, Y-U-S-U-F, Abdi, A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. If it gets worse before then, like if the water starts coming toward the building, call back and we'll bump it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. Sorry for the long call, I'm also in the middle of comparison shopping for a new mattress, so I'm on my phone all day anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:07:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, hopefully that goes better than the grate. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:07:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Abdi. Stay dry out there."
    }
  ],
